{"id":"4a5e6f2f20c35935","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/595_STIT_逻辑.md","title":"595 STIT 逻辑","display":"595_STIT_逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\\)</span> 为非空有限主体集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\\)</span> 上固定线性序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{595}\">\\(&lt;_{595}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{settled},\\operatorname{stit}_a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{settled},\\operatorname{stit}_a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子公式直接由命题变元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}\\)</span> 充当，不另设带标签的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}\\)</span> 构造子。显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\">\\(\\Box A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A\">\\([a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A\\)</span>；下文在公理中用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a]A\">\\([a]A\\)</span> 简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A\">\\([a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A\\)</span>。派生记号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\n\\Diamond A=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\n\\Diamond A=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Ag}_{595})\">\\(G\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Ag}_{595})\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C:G\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(C:G\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span>，按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{595}\">\\(&lt;_{595}\\)</span> 递增枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\{a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1}\\}\">\\(G=\\{a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1}\\}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conj}_{595}(G,C)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\top, &amp; k=0,\\\\\nC(a_0), &amp; k=1,\\\\\nC(a_0)\\land\\operatorname{Conj}_{595}(G\\setminus\\{a_0\\},C|_{G\\setminus\\{a_0\\}}), &amp; k&gt;1.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Conj}_{595}(G,C)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\top, &amp; k=0,\\\\\nC(a_0), &amp; k=1,\\\\\nC(a_0)\\land\\operatorname{Conj}_{595}(G\\setminus\\{a_0\\},C|_{G\\setminus\\{a_0\\}}), &amp; k&gt;1.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\([a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<p>自由命题变元函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{595}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{595}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(\\Box A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{595}([a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{595}([a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{595}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{595}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{595}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{595}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,595}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,595}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{595}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{595})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{595}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{595})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{595}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{595}\\)</span>，替换函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(\\Box A,\\sigma)=\\Box\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}([a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A,\\sigma)=[a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}([a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A,\\sigma)=[a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]\\operatorname{Sub}_{595}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{595}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{595}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{595}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{595}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{595}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{595}=\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定然模态公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\Box}^{595}=\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\Box}^{595}=\\{\\Box(A\\to B)\\to(\\Box A\\to\\Box B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T\\Box}^{595}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4\\Box}^{595}=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{5\\Box}^{595}=\\{\\neg\\Box A\\to\\Box\\neg\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T\\Box}^{595}=\\{\\Box A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{4\\Box}^{595}=\\{\\Box A\\to\\Box\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{5\\Box}^{595}=\\{\\neg\\Box A\\to\\Box\\neg\\Box A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\\)</span>，STIT 公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{595}=\\{[a](A\\to B)\\to([a]A\\to[a]B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{595}=\\{[a](A\\to B)\\to([a]A\\to[a]B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{595}=\\{[a]A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Nec,a}^{595}=\\{\\Box A\\to[a]A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{595}=\\{[a]A\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{Nec,a}^{595}=\\{\\Box A\\to[a]A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>独立性公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ind}^{595}=\n\\{\\operatorname{Conj}_{595}(G,L_{G,A})\\to\\Diamond\\operatorname{Conj}_{595}(G,R_{G,A}):\nG\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}),\\ (A_a)_{a\\in G}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}^{G}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ind}^{595}=\n\\{\\operatorname{Conj}_{595}(G,L_{G,A})\\to\\Diamond\\operatorname{Conj}_{595}(G,R_{G,A}):\nG\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}),\\ (A_a)_{a\\in G}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}^{G}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{G,A}(a)=\\Diamond[a]A_a\">\\(L_{G,A}(a)=\\Diamond[a]A_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{G,A}(a)=[a]A_a\">\\(R_{G,A}(a)=[a]A_a\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{595}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{595}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\Box}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T\\Box}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4\\Box}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5\\Box}^{595}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Nec,a}^{595})\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ind}^{595}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{595}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{595}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K\\Box}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T\\Box}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4\\Box}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5\\Box}^{595}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}}(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{595}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Nec,a}^{595})\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ind}^{595}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{595}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{595}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{595}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{595}=\\{((A),\\Box A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{595}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{595}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\)</span>。每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{595}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{595}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{595}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{595}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{595}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{595}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{595}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{595}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\text{ 使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{595}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{595}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\n\\text{ 使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-独立性证书\">8. 独立性证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"595\">\\(595\\)</span>-独立性证书为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G,(A_a)_{a\\in G})\">\\((G,(A_a)_{a\\in G})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是有限主体集合，证书公式属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ind}^{595}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Ind}^{595}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目包含行动性构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A\">\\([a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A\\)</span> 和独立性公理族；它不是普通多主体模态逻辑。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-STIT-选择语义载体与后承\">10. STIT 选择语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>STIT 框架为五元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F=(M,H,\\mathsf{Hist},\\mathsf{Choice},V)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F=(M,H,\\mathsf{Hist},\\mathsf{Choice},V)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足下列条件。</p>\n<p>时刻集合非空：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>历史集合非空：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个时刻的历史集为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Hist}:M\\to\\mathcal P(H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Hist}:M\\to\\mathcal P(H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall m\\in M\\ \\mathsf{Hist}(m)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall m\\in M\\ \\mathsf{Hist}(m)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>时刻-历史点集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MH}_{595}(F)=\\{(m,h):m\\in M,\\ h\\in\\mathsf{Hist}(m)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MH}_{595}(F)=\\{(m,h):m\\in M,\\ h\\in\\mathsf{Hist}(m)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>选择函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Choice}:\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\\times M\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(H)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Choice}:\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\\times M\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(H)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)\">\\(\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Hist}(m)\">\\(\\mathsf{Hist}(m)\\)</span> 的分割：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)\\Rightarrow \\varnothing\\ne C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Hist}(m),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C\\in\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)\\Rightarrow \\varnothing\\ne C\\subseteq\\mathsf{Hist}(m),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)\\wedge C\\ne D\\Rightarrow C\\cap D=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C,D\\in\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)\\wedge C\\ne D\\Rightarrow C\\cap D=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)=\\mathsf{Hist}(m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigcup\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)=\\mathsf{Hist}(m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>独立性条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ind}_{595}(F)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in M\\ \\forall F_0:\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\\to\\mathcal P(H)\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\\ F_0(a)\\in\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigcap_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}}F_0(a)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ind}_{595}(F)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall m\\in M\\ \\forall F_0:\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\\to\\mathcal P(H)\n\\Bigl(\n\\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}\\ F_0(a)\\in\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigcap_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}}F_0(a)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>赋值为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{MH}_{595}(F)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{MH}_{595}(F)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>STIT 模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{StitMod}_{595}\n=\n\\{F=(M,H,\\mathsf{Hist},\\mathsf{Choice},V):F\\text{ 满足上列条件且 }\\operatorname{Ind}_{595}(F)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{StitMod}_{595}\n=\n\\{F=(M,H,\\mathsf{Hist},\\mathsf{Choice},V):F\\text{ 满足上列条件且 }\\operatorname{Ind}_{595}(F)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathsf{StitMod}_{595}\">\\(F\\in\\mathsf{StitMod}_{595}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m,h)\\in\\mathsf{MH}_{595}(F)\">\\((m,h)\\in\\mathsf{MH}_{595}(F)\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F,m,h\\models_{595}p\\Longleftrightarrow (m,h)\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nF,m,h\\not\\models_{595}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F,m,h\\models_{595}p\\Longleftrightarrow (m,h)\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nF,m,h\\not\\models_{595}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F,m,h\\models_{595}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(F,m,h\\models_{595}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F,m,h\\models_{595}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(F,m,h\\models_{595}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F,m,h\\models_{595}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(F,m,h\\models_{595}A)\\ \\vee\\ F,m,h\\models_{595}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F,m,h\\models_{595}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(F,m,h\\models_{595}A)\\ \\vee\\ F,m,h\\models_{595}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F,m,h\\models_{595}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathsf{Hist}(m)\\ F,m,k\\models_{595}A,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F,m,h\\models_{595}\\Box A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall k\\in\\mathsf{Hist}(m)\\ F,m,k\\models_{595}A,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F,m,h\\models_{595}[a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\in\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)\\ \n\\bigl(h\\in C\\Rightarrow \\forall k\\in C\\ F,m,k\\models_{595}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F,m,h\\models_{595}[a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall C\\in\\mathsf{Choice}(a,m)\\ \n\\bigl(h\\in C\\Rightarrow \\forall k\\in C\\ F,m,k\\models_{595}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{595}^{\\mathsf{stit}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{595}^{\\mathsf{stit}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathsf{StitMod}_{595}\">\\(F\\in\\mathsf{StitMod}_{595}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(m,h)\\in\\mathsf{MH}_{595}(F)\">\\((m,h)\\in\\mathsf{MH}_{595}(F)\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (F,m,h\\models_{595}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (F,m,h\\models_{595}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,m,h\\models_{595}A\">\\(F,m,h\\models_{595}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{STIT}_{595}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ag}_{595},&lt;_{595},\\mathsf{Prop}_{595},\\mathsf{Frm}_{595},\\operatorname{Conj}_{595},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{595},\\operatorname{BV}_{595},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,595},\\mathsf{Subst}_{595},\\operatorname{Sub}_{595},\\mathsf{Ax}_{595},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{595},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{595},\\mathsf{Proof}_{595},\\vdash_{595},\n\\mathsf{MH}_{595},\\operatorname{Ind}_{595},\\mathsf{StitMod}_{595},\\models_{595},\\models_{595}^{\\mathsf{stit}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{STIT}_{595}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ag}_{595},&lt;_{595},\\mathsf{Prop}_{595},\\mathsf{Frm}_{595},\\operatorname{Conj}_{595},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{595},\\operatorname{BV}_{595},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,595},\\mathsf{Subst}_{595},\\operatorname{Sub}_{595},\\mathsf{Ax}_{595},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{595},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Nec\\Box}^{595},\\mathsf{Proof}_{595},\\vdash_{595},\n\\mathsf{MH}_{595},\\operatorname{Ind}_{595},\\mathsf{StitMod}_{595},\\models_{595},\\models_{595}^{\\mathsf{stit}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含 STIT 句法、公理、规则、证明对象、可证性、moment-history 载体、选择函数语义和语义后承；不含可靠性证明或完备性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-独立性证书","text":"8. 独立性证书","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-STIT-选择语义载体与后承","text":"10. STIT 选择语义载体与后承","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{settled},\\operatorname{stit}_a.","display":true},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A","display":false},{"tex":"[a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A","display":false},{"tex":"[a]A","display":false},{"tex":"[a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A","display":false},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\n\\Diamond A=\\neg\\Box\\neg A.","display":true},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Ag}_{595})","display":false},{"tex":"C:G\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"<_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"G=\\{a_0,\\ldots,a_{k-1}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conj}_{595}(G,C)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\top, & k=0,\\\\\nC(a_0), & k=1,\\\\\nC(a_0)\\land\\operatorname{Conj}_{595}(G\\setminus\\{a_0\\},C|_{G\\setminus\\{a_0\\}}), & k>1.\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"[a\\ \\mathsf{stit}]A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{595}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{595}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{595}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{595}(\\neg A